From d3ed0e76a981b496f04e4e9efb8973c280316e07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MICHAEL BARTHOLOMEW <auricrux@futurecontractorsofamerica.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 14:37:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Enterprise Harden PR-1: streaming, auth gate, SSRF,
 audit/moderation

Close major-player parity gaps vs Copilot/Gemini/Claude/Grok/ChatGPT that
do not require fine-tune export (AUX-017/018) or peer API keys (AUX-027):

- SSE chat streaming at POST /api/chat/stream
- Product API auth middleware when Auth:Enabled
- SSRF harden browse (no redirects, DNS private/ULA/CGNAT deny)
- Content moderation floor + append-only audit JSONL
- Tenant-isolated workspace under Auth
- Client multi-turn history + server InteractionId feedback
- Citations/thinking UI in Chat.razor
- Claims AUX-037..042 + capabilities matrix updates
